# Build context filter for docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Lets a plain `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .` from the solution root send only what
# the image needs; without it the context includes .work/ (several GB of caches and runs).
*
!src
!tools
!docker
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
